<title>INDIA: CRICKET-INDIA 57-1 AT CLOSE V AUSTRALIA (182).</title>
<headline>CRICKET-INDIA 57-1 AT CLOSE V AUSTRALIA (182).</headline>
<dateline>NEW DELHI 1996-10-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>India were 57-1 in reply to Australia's first innings of 182 at the close on the opening day of their one-off test at the Feroze Shah Kotla ground on Thursday.</p>
</text>
